WEBVTT

00:08.842 --> 00:16.883
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.883 --> 00:24.881
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.399 --> 00:36.202
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.202 --> 00:39.205
Believing, dreaming

00:39.205 --> 00:43.043
We are searching

00:43.043 --> 00:48.174
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.983 --> 00:58.391
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.391 --> 01:02.962
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.962 --> 01:05.632
Ah, surely someday

01:05.632 --> 01:13.907
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.907 --> 01:18.867
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.413 --> 01:27.046
Let's begin our journey

01:31.925 --> 01:36.555
Our last attempt was a failure,
wasn't it, Verdandi?

01:38.565 --> 01:39.998
I'm sorry.

01:40.366 --> 01:42.732
I'm not reprimanding you.

01:43.670 --> 01:46.434
So I guess it's my turn next!

01:46.773 --> 01:49.139
Have you come up with a good plan, Skuld?

01:50.143 --> 01:51.633
Of course!

02:14.701 --> 02:16.498
Come out...

02:20.673 --> 02:22.106
Heidrun.

02:35.388 --> 02:37.185
Leave this to me.

02:38.024 --> 02:43.792
The 17th Night
Crashing into Kitchen Sanctuary!

02:44.597 --> 02:46.466
Master Loki!

02:46.466 --> 02:47.797
I did it!

02:48.501 --> 02:50.170
Please have a look at this!

02:50.170 --> 02:53.901
I've been chosen to participate
in Kitchen Sanctuary.

02:54.574 --> 02:56.667
Kitchen Sanctuary?

02:57.477 --> 02:59.212
"The masters of food!"

02:59.212 --> 03:02.815
"Those indomitable men who are as brethren
to those in the sacred profession!"

03:02.815 --> 03:06.649
"Gather round, ye who serve
the God of Cookery."

03:07.053 --> 03:09.419
"To the most hallowed
cooking grounds we go!"

03:16.095 --> 03:18.222
What was that all about?

03:19.966 --> 03:22.468
It's a popular TV show in which chefs
who pride themselves on their skills

03:22.468 --> 03:24.436
compete against one other.

03:26.105 --> 03:28.164
And you're going to appear
on that show, Yamino?

03:28.408 --> 03:31.311
Yes! I've been sending in postcards
for the longest time,

03:31.311 --> 03:33.472
and now I'm finally able to
take part in the show!

03:33.913 --> 03:35.582
I wanna be on it too!

03:35.582 --> 03:38.751
You're allowed to have two assistants, right?

03:38.751 --> 03:41.117
Why, yes. If you wouldn't mind.

03:41.354 --> 03:42.689
Gotcha!

03:42.689 --> 03:44.657
Just leave everything to me!

03:44.657 --> 03:46.059
Narukami?

03:46.059 --> 03:47.185
Where did you come from?

03:48.027 --> 03:50.723
Never mind that. I'm going with you too!

03:50.997 --> 03:53.488
Huh? You are?

03:53.600 --> 03:57.127
Yup! I've built up my skills working
at all these restaurants.

03:58.538 --> 03:59.903
And I'll show ya!

04:00.206 --> 04:02.606
Uh, yes. But...

04:03.176 --> 04:05.912
Nothing I say would stop him.

04:05.912 --> 04:08.210
Maybe I should just accept his offer.

04:08.548 --> 04:12.252
All right then! Let's go cook up a storm!

04:12.252 --> 04:13.953
For 100,000 yen I could buy
100 extra-large beef bowls.

04:13.953 --> 04:15.288
I could get that secret "Aliens at
the co-ed open-air bath"
For 100,000 yen I could buy
100 extra-large beef bowls.

04:15.288 --> 04:16.823
I could get that secret "Aliens at
the co-ed open-air bath"
No, 200 even!

04:16.823 --> 04:17.657
NASA video that I've always wanted!
No, 200 even!

04:17.657 --> 04:18.992
NASA video that I've always wanted!
I could even get some miso soup with 'em!

04:18.992 --> 04:19.826
Um... Are you even listening?
NASA video that I've always wanted!
I could even get some miso soup with 'em!

04:19.826 --> 04:20.360
Um... Are you even listening?
NASA video that I've always wanted!

04:20.360 --> 04:20.917
Um... Are you even listening?

04:21.160 --> 04:22.362
Aim for...

04:22.362 --> 04:23.596
the prize money!

04:23.596 --> 04:25.791
One hundred thousand yen!

04:26.132 --> 04:29.168
Are you sure about this?
They're going to take your prize money.

04:29.168 --> 04:30.370
Yes.

04:30.370 --> 04:33.606
I just want to take the same skills
I use to prepare your meals

04:33.606 --> 04:35.574
and put them to the test.

04:38.044 --> 04:39.511
If you please!

04:40.413 --> 04:42.849
Party of three under the name
Ryusuke Yamino.

04:42.849 --> 04:45.985
We've come to participate
in Kitchen Sanctuary.

04:45.985 --> 04:48.154
Please proceed to Studio 105.

04:48.154 --> 04:49.451
All right, let's go!

04:50.189 --> 04:52.316
TV shows are such a mystery!

04:52.925 --> 04:54.594
Thank you very much.

04:54.594 --> 04:56.221
Excuse me, little boy!

04:56.829 --> 04:59.532
You're not allowed to bring
pets into the studio.

04:59.532 --> 05:02.524
But Fenrir is a member of our family.

05:02.769 --> 05:05.135
I'm sorry, but rules are rules.

05:12.645 --> 05:14.647
Go on ahead!

05:14.647 --> 05:16.114
Thanks.

05:19.519 --> 05:22.386
Participants, please go inside first.

05:22.722 --> 05:24.691
We'll see you in there, Master Loki.

05:24.691 --> 05:24.724
Let's go get 'em! All right!
We'll see you in there, Master Loki.

05:24.724 --> 05:25.358
Let's go get 'em! All right!

05:25.358 --> 05:26.359
Let's go get 'em! All right!
Oh, how cute!

05:26.359 --> 05:27.656
Oh, how cute!

05:27.960 --> 05:30.485
Hey, little boy, what agency are you with?

05:30.830 --> 05:35.392
Um... Well... I came here to cheer on
my friends in Kitchen Sanctuary.

05:36.569 --> 05:38.304
So you're a visitor?

05:38.304 --> 05:41.741
You're so cute, I wish I could
make you an actor!

05:41.741 --> 05:43.368
Thank you.

05:43.543 --> 05:44.977
Let me give you a hug.

05:44.977 --> 05:45.944
Uh, sure.

05:46.312 --> 05:48.247
You really are so cute!

05:48.247 --> 05:51.184
Why don't you join my agency?
I'm sure you'd be a real hit!

05:51.184 --> 05:52.185
That's nice.

05:52.185 --> 05:55.054
Say, do you like older women?

05:55.054 --> 05:56.255
They're nice.

05:56.255 --> 05:57.590
Oh, really?

05:57.590 --> 06:01.890
Well, if you can't find any girlfriends when
you grow up, I'll marry you, okay?

06:02.962 --> 06:03.429
Master Loki, they said you can come in now.

06:03.429 --> 06:04.364
Huh?
Master Loki, they said you can come in now.

06:04.364 --> 06:05.498
Master Loki, they said you can come in now.

06:05.498 --> 06:07.300
Well, be seeing you.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.598
Oh, too bad. See you later, okay?

06:12.638 --> 06:14.474
Hi, Loki!

06:14.474 --> 06:16.271
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:16.542 --> 06:18.378
Huh? Where's Loki?

06:18.378 --> 06:20.744
I haven't seen you before.

06:21.714 --> 06:23.306
First time here?

06:23.816 --> 06:27.217
C'mon, they're shooting "Hot Water
Cosplay Night" over this way.

06:27.453 --> 06:28.477
Hurry!

06:28.721 --> 06:31.023
And you've gotta be friendly!
Give it all you've got!

06:31.023 --> 06:32.191
Um...

06:32.191 --> 06:33.488
All you've got!

06:34.160 --> 06:35.895
Sorry, Reiya!

06:35.895 --> 06:36.963
Huh?

06:36.963 --> 06:38.260
Reiya?

06:38.631 --> 06:41.267
Master Loki! It's starting.

06:41.267 --> 06:42.894
Ah. Okay.

06:44.871 --> 06:46.873
The masters of food!

06:46.873 --> 06:49.501
Those indomitable men who are as brethren
to those in the sacred profession!

06:52.278 --> 06:56.149
Gather round, ye who serve
the God of Cookery.

06:56.149 --> 06:58.050
To the most hallowed cooking grounds we go!

06:58.050 --> 06:58.084
Kitchen Sanctuary
To the most hallowed cooking grounds we go!

06:58.084 --> 07:00.753
Kitchen Sanctuary

07:00.753 --> 07:02.522
Kitchen Sanctuary
This is Kitchen Sanctuary!

07:02.522 --> 07:04.581
Kitchen Sanctuary
Tonight, the holy battle begins anew!

07:26.612 --> 07:29.274
Hey, Daddy! Daddy! Can I eat that?

07:41.060 --> 07:44.496
And now, introducing tonight's competitors!

07:45.565 --> 07:47.600
In the red corner!

07:47.600 --> 07:51.904
Facing tonight's challenge with the
determination to defeat any and all opponents,

07:51.904 --> 07:56.364
led by Ryusuke Yamino, it's Team Snake!

07:58.077 --> 07:59.977
And in the blue corner!

08:00.746 --> 08:04.817
With sharp, keen eyes focused on
TV shows offering prize money,

08:04.817 --> 08:09.049
it's Team Hawk, led by Kazumi Higashiyama.

08:13.860 --> 08:16.429
If it isn't my Japanese beauty!

08:16.429 --> 08:18.056
Hi, Mr. Thief!

08:20.233 --> 08:22.997
I can't believe you're my opponent.

08:23.603 --> 08:25.538
There is no way I'll lose to you.

08:25.538 --> 08:27.540
That would be my line!

08:27.540 --> 08:29.337
The prize money will be mine.

08:30.576 --> 08:33.412
'Cause if it isn't, we won't be
able to pay our rent!

08:33.412 --> 08:35.039
Will you shut up?!

08:35.414 --> 08:40.086
So what? I haven't had a single bite
to eat for the past two days!

08:40.086 --> 08:42.316
Is being broke really something
to brag about?

08:42.889 --> 08:44.957
It looks like this will be a bitter match.

08:44.957 --> 08:46.254
Looks like it, Daddy.

08:46.926 --> 08:52.932
Tonight, we would like to pick our
judge from the audience.

08:52.932 --> 08:56.424
Would the gentleman who caught the
tomato please come to the stage?

08:58.471 --> 08:59.597
Me?

09:00.606 --> 09:02.608
Looks like the show is about to start, huh?

09:02.608 --> 09:06.442
Still, this is Loki we're after.
I don't know if this is going to work.

09:07.146 --> 09:09.842
As always, you're such a worrywart.

09:10.449 --> 09:14.112
Let's just let Skuld carry out her plan.

09:14.720 --> 09:17.348
After all, it's only just begun.

09:19.158 --> 09:22.695
And now, we present our ingredient
for tonight's challenge!

09:22.695 --> 09:23.162
Tonight's Theme
And now, we present our ingredient
for tonight's challenge!

09:23.162 --> 09:24.857
Tonight's Theme
The theme for tonight's food is this!

09:31.370 --> 09:34.339
Wow, it's alive! And squirming!

09:34.640 --> 09:37.108
It's a giant peach-spotted king squid!

09:37.343 --> 09:39.078
What a strange mystery!

09:39.078 --> 09:42.411
It's an Unidentified Mysterious Animal,
an elusive creature of the deep!

09:42.615 --> 09:45.451
How lucky that we'd run into it here!

09:45.451 --> 09:46.953
Right? Right?!

09:46.953 --> 09:48.454
We gotta eat this?

09:48.454 --> 09:50.615
We couldn't have asked for
more worthy ingredients!

09:50.856 --> 09:54.485
It's huge! I'll bet that would
fill you up real well!

09:56.929 --> 09:59.420
The prize money's as good as ours.

09:59.799 --> 10:01.667
It looks delicious, doesn't it?

10:01.667 --> 10:04.397
What do you think?
Makes you hungry, doesn't it?

10:09.475 --> 10:11.344
Hear me, Heidrun.

10:11.344 --> 10:17.305
Even the evil god Loki shouldn't be able
to withstand an attack from the inside.

10:18.584 --> 10:23.146
Now use your transformation powers
and enter the body of Lord Loki!

10:42.642 --> 10:45.202
I'm counting on you, Heidrun.

10:54.053 --> 10:56.419
Well then, let's begin!

10:59.158 --> 11:01.592
A mere pig is no match for me!

11:01.927 --> 11:04.163
We can't have you underestimating us.

11:04.163 --> 11:07.826
Show him your power, Gullinbursti!

11:19.745 --> 11:22.145
This meat is minced!

11:23.582 --> 11:26.252
I don't think that's what you'd call minced.

11:26.252 --> 11:28.220
It's kind of a mess, Daddy.

11:28.721 --> 11:30.189
Not bad!

11:30.189 --> 11:31.624
Now it's my turn!

11:31.624 --> 11:36.652
Ultimate secret technique:
Shredded Highlands Cabbage!

11:41.133 --> 11:43.101
How do we use it if you smash it to pieces?

11:43.302 --> 11:45.204
It's fine! It's just shredded, I tell you! Shredded!

11:45.204 --> 11:46.772
It's fine! It's just shredded, I tell you! Shredded!
That 100,000-yen prize is as good as ours.

11:46.772 --> 11:48.140
Yamino!
That 100,000-yen prize is as good as ours.

11:48.140 --> 11:48.572
That 100,000-yen prize is as good as ours.

11:48.941 --> 11:50.643
What did you say?!

11:50.643 --> 11:52.311
I believe that...

11:52.311 --> 11:53.608
is my line!

11:53.946 --> 11:57.677
When the food is ready, make sure
you eat it all up, okay?

11:57.883 --> 12:01.341
If the food ever is ready with
the way things are now.

12:01.520 --> 12:04.623
Organic Irish Cobbler Potato, Hack and Slash!

12:04.623 --> 12:06.750
Please don't smash the produce!

12:08.294 --> 12:11.092
I totally touched the giant
peach-spotted king squid!

12:11.430 --> 12:13.933
Pound it! Pound it, Gullinbursti!

12:13.933 --> 12:16.265
Pound it till nothing is left but ash!

12:16.869 --> 12:19.030
Don't go crushing my pumpkin!

12:38.090 --> 12:42.527
First up, we have squid carpaccio
a la provencal.

12:42.962 --> 12:45.965
Team Snake has completed their first dish!

12:45.965 --> 12:48.534
How many more do you plan to make?

12:48.534 --> 12:51.992
We will continue to cook as
long as time allows!

12:52.304 --> 12:54.106
Go for it!!

12:54.106 --> 12:55.141
Go for it!!
Go for it!

12:55.141 --> 12:55.470
Go for it!

12:56.408 --> 12:58.171
That sure looks good, Daddy.

13:00.346 --> 13:02.075
Here I go, Yamino!

13:04.483 --> 13:07.145
Secret Technique: Wild Dance of the Meteors!

13:15.728 --> 13:17.630
That's awesome, Yamino!

13:17.630 --> 13:19.532
Not bad, Four-Eyes.

13:19.532 --> 13:21.200
Stop, you're embarrassing me!

13:21.200 --> 13:23.435
Damn it! You think you've beaten us?

13:23.435 --> 13:24.436
Frey!

13:24.436 --> 13:26.272
Let me handle this.

13:26.272 --> 13:29.108
I've got Gullinbursti on my side!

13:29.108 --> 13:30.132
Gullinbursti!

13:33.078 --> 13:35.214
What are we going to do with
crushed cucumbers?

13:35.214 --> 13:39.173
You're right. Gullinbursti!
Chop 'em up even finer!

13:41.420 --> 13:43.115
Listen to me, dammit!

13:45.791 --> 13:47.993
You're amazing, Yamino!

13:47.993 --> 13:49.695
I'll have this done in a second,

13:49.695 --> 13:52.031
so please get the dishes and
put some lettuce on them.

13:52.031 --> 13:52.998
Okay!

13:53.232 --> 13:55.134
Let's see, lettuce, lettuce...

13:55.134 --> 13:56.965
Huh? There's no lettuce.

14:07.847 --> 14:11.283
Yamino! This tomato just turned
into a head of lettuce!

14:11.817 --> 14:14.186
Well that's fortunate, isn't it?

14:14.186 --> 14:18.282
Oh. I didn't know tomatoes
turned into lettuce.

14:22.027 --> 14:22.394
I'll go get a tentacle!

14:22.394 --> 14:24.263
I'll go get a tentacle!
I just ended up cooking everything on my own!

14:24.263 --> 14:25.431
Okay, be careful.
I just ended up cooking everything on my own!

14:25.431 --> 14:25.920
Okay, be careful.

14:26.999 --> 14:31.026
If you're challenging me to a match,
you obviously don't know your place.

14:31.704 --> 14:36.732
Finely slicing farm-fresh daikon radish
is Mjolnir's and my specialty!

14:38.043 --> 14:42.412
I thought I might face this situation,
and have already prepared a new weapon!

14:43.015 --> 14:44.642
A new weapon?

14:45.451 --> 14:47.987
Come forth, daikon-slicing machine!

14:47.987 --> 14:49.784
Wandering Chef Ken!

14:55.794 --> 15:00.254
Interesting! We'll see which can slice
better, that thing or Mjolnir!

15:03.936 --> 15:05.733
Take this!

15:06.171 --> 15:08.007
That's just what I wanted!

15:08.007 --> 15:12.876
Behold, Wandering Chef Ken's
6,000-revolutions-per-second slicer!

15:19.418 --> 15:20.885
Watch out, Heimdall!

15:31.330 --> 15:33.355
Are you trying to kill me?!

15:33.732 --> 15:37.031
Oh, Heimdall. The important thing
is that you're safe.

15:38.070 --> 15:39.838
Help!

15:39.838 --> 15:41.840
The squid's puttin' the squeeze on me!

15:41.840 --> 15:43.364
What are you doing, Mayura?

15:46.045 --> 15:48.714
Squeezy McSqueeze-n-Fondle!

15:48.714 --> 15:50.382
Get it off!

15:50.382 --> 15:52.084
The squeeze! The squeeze! The squeeze!

15:52.084 --> 15:52.618
Hey, Mayura!
The squeeze! The squeeze! The squeeze!

15:52.618 --> 15:53.452
Hey, Mayura!
Squeezy McSqueeze-n-Foooondle!

15:53.452 --> 15:55.977
Squeezy McSqueeze-n-Foooondle!

15:56.088 --> 15:57.823
What's with her, Daddy?

15:57.823 --> 15:58.949
Beats me.

16:03.662 --> 16:04.730
C'mon!
Yeah!

16:04.730 --> 16:06.027
Go for it!

16:06.632 --> 16:07.826
Freya!

16:10.302 --> 16:12.037
Amazing!

16:12.037 --> 16:14.699
That's "Supernova" Freya, a contestant
who appeared from out of nowhere!

16:14.773 --> 16:17.207
Hot Water!!
Cosplay Night

16:17.509 --> 16:19.511
Now that's what I call a hottie
disappearing into the steam!

16:19.511 --> 16:22.448
Freya's battle bat has seen the truth!

16:22.448 --> 16:24.416
What do you think, sir?

16:25.584 --> 16:27.449
She's quite stacked, isn't she?

16:27.886 --> 16:29.945
Loki? Are you watching?

16:30.122 --> 16:32.750
Squeezy McSqueeze! Squeezy McSqueeeeze!

16:38.030 --> 16:40.966
Kitchen Sanctuary

16:40.966 --> 16:43.369
Kitchen Sanctuary
Well, the match is over!

16:43.369 --> 16:45.571
Kitchen Sanctuary
Now to sample the food!

16:45.571 --> 16:45.798
Kitchen Sanctuary

16:49.675 --> 16:50.972
It's just about time.

16:51.744 --> 16:54.679
If Lord Loki eats this...

16:54.747 --> 16:54.913
Team Snake

16:54.913 --> 16:57.383
our plan will be successful.
Team Snake

16:57.383 --> 17:01.720
Team Snake has made a splendid
full-course meal of eight dishes!
Team Snake

17:01.720 --> 17:01.754
Team Snake

17:01.754 --> 17:04.490
Team Hawk
And their opponents, Team Hawk...

17:04.490 --> 17:06.685
Team Hawk
Are they putting all their stock in a single dish?

17:07.259 --> 17:10.695
Before the judging begins, let's hear
a word from the competitors.

17:10.929 --> 17:14.299
Please enjoy the meal, Master Loki.

17:14.299 --> 17:16.995
If you don't say it's delicious, I'll kill you.

17:17.336 --> 17:20.703
Please start with Team Snake's
food, if you would.

17:21.774 --> 17:24.902
Team Snake

17:45.264 --> 17:46.932
What's wrong?

17:46.932 --> 17:50.169
Please, hurry up and eat.

17:50.169 --> 17:52.603
Sorry, but I can't eat this.

17:53.806 --> 17:56.542
Yamino's cooking isn't suited
to being seasoned

17:56.542 --> 17:59.278
with the poisonous spices of evil.

17:59.278 --> 18:02.514
Or would you like to try
some for yourself...

18:02.514 --> 18:03.879
Skuld?

18:04.583 --> 18:05.880
Skuld?!

18:06.285 --> 18:08.921
You mean this food is tainted with evil?!

18:08.921 --> 18:10.255
Yes.

18:10.255 --> 18:11.882
Um, well...

18:12.658 --> 18:17.459
With so much evil hanging over the
food here, I was bound to notice.

18:19.064 --> 18:24.403
Yamino was looking forward to this show,
so I kept quiet and played along.

18:24.403 --> 18:28.999
But this ends here. I don't have much
of an appetite for your evil.

18:29.875 --> 18:31.240
I see.

18:31.910 --> 18:34.913
Then I'll just have to use force!

18:34.913 --> 18:36.039
Heidrun!

19:00.839 --> 19:05.777
Lord Loki! By order of Odin,
ruler of the gods...

19:05.777 --> 19:07.813
I shall destroy you!

19:07.813 --> 19:09.748
That's my duty!

19:09.748 --> 19:11.773
What?! Is that true?

19:11.950 --> 19:13.315
Heidrun!

19:24.696 --> 19:26.823
You'll never beat me with brute strength.

19:33.705 --> 19:35.070
Skuld! Watch out!

19:43.182 --> 19:45.650
Are you all right, Skuld?

19:46.818 --> 19:48.217
Why...

19:54.092 --> 19:57.789
Dear me. I believe I'll have to do something
before you continue with this rampage.

20:20.953 --> 20:22.853
Roar, Mjolnir!

20:30.862 --> 20:32.989
Now, Loki!

20:45.010 --> 20:46.534
Veil lubadrock!

20:47.813 --> 20:49.212
Cuerios!

21:00.158 --> 21:01.660
Where's Skuld?

21:01.660 --> 21:04.686
Damn. She sure takes off in a hurry.

